_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"1魏龐涓伐韓。韓請救於齊。齊威王召大臣而謀曰：「蚤救孰與晚救？」成侯曰：「不如勿救。」田忌曰：「弗救則韓且折而入於魏，不如蚤救之。」孫臏曰：「夫韓、魏之兵未弊而救之。是吾代韓受魏之兵，顧反聽命於韓也。且魏有破國之志，韓見亡，必東面而愬於齊矣。吾因深結韓之親而晚承魏之弊，則可受重利而得尊名也。」王曰：「善。」乃陰許韓使而遣之。韓因恃齊，五戰不勝，而東委國於齊。","content_fanyi":"魏国庞涓率军攻打韩国。韩国向齐国求救。齐威王召集大臣商议，说：“早救与晚救相比，哪个更好？”成侯邹忌说：“不如不救。”田忌说：“如果不救，韩国就会战败而投入魏国，被魏国吞并，不如早救。”孙膑说：“韩、魏两国的军队还没有疲惫，我们就去救援，等于是我们代替韩国承受魏军的攻击，反而会听从韩国的调遣。况且魏国有攻灭韩国的野心，韩国看到自己有灭亡的危险，必定会向东来向齐国诉苦。我们借此机会加深与韩国的亲善关系，同时又晚一些趁魏军疲惫时加以攻击，这样就可以获得重大利益和尊贵的名声。”齐威王说：“好。”于是暗中应允韩国使者的请求，让他带着救援的信息回国。韩国因此倚仗齐国，全力与魏国交战，五次交战都失败了，这才向东投靠齐国，把国运托付给齐国。","content_jianti_auto":"1魏庞涓伐韩。韩请救于齐。齐威王召大臣而谋曰：「蚤救孰与晚救？」成侯曰：「不如勿救。」田忌曰：「弗救则韩且折而入于魏，不如蚤救之。」孙膑曰：「夫韩、魏之兵未弊而救之。是吾代韩受魏之兵，顾反听命于韩也。且魏有破国之志，韩见亡，必东面而愬于齐矣。吾因深结韩之亲而晚承魏之弊，则可受重利而得尊名也。」王曰：「善。」乃阴许韩使而遣之。韩因恃齐，五战不胜，而东委国于齐。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":163,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c304394-db0e-11ef-a835-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"盼，與盻同，音匹莧翻。將，卽亮翻；下同。又音如字，領也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"盼，与盻同，音匹苋翻。将，即亮翻；下同。又音如字，领也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c3043b7-db0e-11ef-bc65-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孫武子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孙武子","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c3043bc-db0e-11ef-a7c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏武帝","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c3043bd-db0e-11ef-aff7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘氏","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8c3043be-db0e-11ef-92b2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此孫武子兵法也。趣，七喻翻。魏武帝曰：蹶，其月翻。蹶，猶挫也。劉氏曰：蹶，猶斃也。半至，謂軍趣利前後不相屬，半至半不至也。屬，陟玉翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此孙武子兵法也。趣，七喻翻。魏武帝曰：蹶，其月翻。蹶，犹挫也。刘氏曰：蹶，犹毙也。半至，谓军趣利前后不相属，半至半不至也。属，陟玉翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"8c3043bb-db0e-11ef-a6d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"句斷。龐，薄江翻。涓，圭淵翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"句断。庞，薄江翻。涓，圭渊翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":188,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c1-db0e-11ef-8b1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"幷行，兼程而行也。倍日，一日行兩日之程，亦兼程也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"幷行，兼程而行也。倍日，一日行两日之程，亦兼程也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c2-db0e-11ef-a2a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"司馬彪","people_name_jianti_auto":"司马彪","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c4-db0e-11ef-b9d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c5-db0e-11ef-97d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"龐涓","people_name_jianti_auto":"庞涓","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c6-db0e-11ef-8851-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虞喜","people_name_jianti_auto":"虞喜","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c7-db0e-11ef-a13a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c8-db0e-11ef-8762-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"元城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"元城县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c9-db0e-11ef-b887-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馬陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"马陵","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c3043ca-db0e-11ef-bbd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馬陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"马陵","place_note":"河北大名","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c3043cb-db0e-11ef-8145-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濮州","place_name_jianti_auto":"濮州","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c3043cc-db0e-11ef-bbe0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄄城","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄄城","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8c3043cd-db0e-11ef-80ec-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"司馬彪志：魏郡元城縣。註云：左傳成七年，會馬陵；杜預註，在縣東南，龐涓死處。虞喜志林：馬陵在濮州鄄城東北六十里，澗谷深，可以置伏。度，徒洛翻。鄄，吉掾翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"司马彪志：魏郡元城县。注云：左传成七年，会马陵；杜预注，在县东南，庞涓死处。虞喜志林：马陵在濮州鄄城东北六十里，涧谷深，可以置伏。度，徒洛翻。鄄，吉掾翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":211,"tongjian_id":"8c3043c3-db0e-11ef-8a28-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"陿，與狹同。隘，烏懈翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"陿，与狭同。隘，乌懈翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":225,"tongjian_id":"8c3043d3-db0e-11ef-87b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c3043d5-db0e-11ef-81a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"龐，薄江翻。涓，工玄翻。剄，古頂翻，斷首也；康：古定切，非。豎，殊遇翻。說文：豎使布短衣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"庞，薄江翻。涓，工玄翻。刭，古顶翻，断首也；康：古定切，非。竖，殊遇翻。说文：竖使布短衣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":328,"tongjian_id":"8c3043d4-db0e-11ef-a4b6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officia